64
00:08:09,744 --> 00:08:34,248
[Host] That's all for today. In Kyoto, the famous Gion Festival is at its height. Its giant floats, built with rope and not a single nail, were finished from the tenth through the fourteenth, and on the seventeenth twenty-three of them will parade through the city. It's one of Japan's three great festivals, with over a thousand years of history. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

